OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to crew of fishing
OL,4,Aboat missing off Lewis
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to three
OL,7,Ffishermen whose boat went missing off
OL,8,Fnorth Lewis in the Western Isles on
OL,9,FTuesday.
OL,11,FDouglas Craigie's body was found on
OL,12,FWednesday - the day before his 50th
OL,13,Fbirthday.
OL,15,FIsles MP Torcuil Crichton said Mr
OL,16,FCraigie's devastated family were now
OL,17,Fplanning his funeral, and the islands
OL,18,Fwould miss the "sparkle" of his wit and
OL,19,Fcharm.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
